      "title": "Keep The Job Clear",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The key question is simple: who is the subject? Choose the pronoun that matches that person or group, then use it as the subject of the sentence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "level": "note",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "These are subject forms. Norwegian also has other pronoun forms after some verbs and prepositions, but the subject forms here are the ones you need for the person or group the sentence is about."
                }
